{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id478841859"}, "name":{"label":"Fauna111"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-31T00:05:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.6.5"}, "id":{"label":"13081314548"}, "title":{"label":"Used to be great"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using this app for years, it is (was) super helpful. Previously (2023) the app offered a one time cost of $2.99 to go premium - ad free, pinning widgets to Lock Screen, etc. Recently (2025) the app stopped working entirely on my phone. I emailed the developer, but received no response. As a last ditch effort, I attempted to delete and re-download the app to see if that might help. Now the app works, but there is no option to restore my previous “one time” purchase, because the option has instead been replaced by a monthly subscription. Seems intentional and opportunistic 👎🏻", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id233849411"}, "name":{"label":"Ramanbir"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-28T09:31:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.6.5"}, "id":{"label":"13071169342"}, "title":{"label":"Great for reminders and to stay on top of things"}, "content":{"label":"Great app with a useful widget, thank you! But as a paying user, I expect better. ‘Live Activities’ and Lock Screen options often disappear, making it hard to quickly glance at my to-do list. Needs a bold option, custom font color/size for individual words, and a chart view with rows and columns. Developers should take reviews seriously and update accordingly.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
