{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id85441937"}, "name":{"label":"Rootttttttt"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-02T11:44:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.6.5"}, "id":{"label":"12968096743"}, "title":{"label":"Not worth it"}, "content":{"label":"This app has always been a bit buggy but not enough to where it truly bothered me and I’ve been using it basically every day since I downloaded it. It wasn’t perfect but it worked perfectly for what I needed. There’s been a couple updates that I haven’t liked (like adding the ugly darker transparent background when using the list instead of just keeping it the same color), but I could get past that because I liked the app and it was more of an aesthetic preference and didn’t have any effect on the apps usefulness.\n\nBut I just updated the app the other day and it changed from fully crossing things off your list by putting a line through them to instead just have a small super buggy check next to the word. Not only is it a pain to actually get it to acknowledge when I’m trying to check something off, but it’s also not nearly as effective for me. Having the strike-through helped me better visual everything. It wouldn’t have been a big deal if it was something you were given the option on, like choosing whether you want a strike-through or a check, but the fact you have no choice just like there was no choice with the ugly transparent background change is extremely annoying.\n\nEven if you like to use checks I wouldn’t recommend this app given just how buggy the checks are. And if you don’t them or like to have options then I would suggest finding something else. Maybe the paid version gives you choices for these but I don’t think so and considering how well the app works… it’s definitely not worth the money. As is I guess I’ll be trying to find and adapt to a whole new app because this one is no longer useful to me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id490631037"}, "name":{"label":"Keecho2020"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-28T20:12:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.6.5"}, "id":{"label":"12948957037"}, "title":{"label":"Second time I’ve lost all my notes"}, "content":{"label":"When the app works it’s great but this is the second time I’ve lost all my notes. I go to open the app and I get a black screen. I’ve tried to restart my phone and nothing. Can someone help?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id108958632"}, "name":{"label":"Natee P"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-27T16:29:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.6.5"}, "id":{"label":"12944397774"}, "title":{"label":"Keeps crashing"}, "content":{"label":"Tried using this app twice.  Crashed both times and lost all notes.  Tried subscribing because I thought that I lost notes first time because trial period ran out without warning, but crashed again anyway.  Really wanted to use this app.  Could not find support link anywhere.  Really disappointed.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24077106"}, "name":{"label":"TheNorm1404"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-25T08:02:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.6.5"}, "id":{"label":"12935087350"}, "title":{"label":"App is broken now"}, "content":{"label":"Unreliable app. For some reason over the past few days, I cannot access the app. When I open it, all I see is a dark blur of colors. I tried uninstalling and reinstalling the app, and tried to use my subscription to restore my notes, but everything is lost. And tapping on the “restore archived notes” just reveals the same dark blurred color screen. Tried to find any means of contacting developer for support and realise there was none. Use at your own risk of losing everything!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
