{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id28744817"}, "name":{"label":"NikkiRox#1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-11T03:19:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.6.5"}, "id":{"label":"12878576174"}, "title":{"label":"Glitches"}, "content":{"label":"I have had this app for a while now. Yesterday I turned off my iPad and forgot to turn it back on. I turn it back on today. The very first sticky note I have from this app is gone. The template to create a new sticky note is there. So I try to restore this note. But it won’t let me restore it. I have 3 other sticky notes from this app, they are all fine. I can see the note I want in the color I want in the list of notes. But when I choose it nothing is happening. What happened to cause the note to disappear? I know you all want me to upgrade, but I DO NOT need all the features the paid version offers. Is that why this happened?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
